            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 1.0.25

- Added an instant Google Meet link button in the Calendar panel: it creates a standalone video-call room and copies its link without creating a Calendar event.
- Added quick actions to copy an existing Google Meet event link and open Google Calendar from the Calendar panel.

]]></description>
